"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/blog\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Blog\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/ai-tools\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"AI Creator Tools\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/support\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Support Us\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/privacy-policy\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Privacy Policy\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/terms\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Terms of Service\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/cookie-policy\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Cookie Policy\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/contact\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Contact\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/request-tool\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Request a Tool\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/resources\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Resources\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/affiliate-disclosure\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Affiliate Disclosure\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/advertise\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Advertise\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/partners\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Partners\\\"}]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Email:\\\",\\\" \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"mailto:support@a2zconvertor.co.uk\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"support@a2zconvertor.co.uk\\\"}]]}]]}]]}],\\\"$L3b\\\",\\\"$L3c\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The important thing is to choose the fix that matches the real problem. If the issue is compatibility, conversion helps. If the issue is file size, compression or resizing is usually better. If the issue is presentation, cropping, format choice or page export may matter more than making the file smaller.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The important thing is to choose the fix that matches the real problem. If the issue is compatibility, conversion helps. If the issue is file size, compression or resizing is usually better. If the issue is presentation, cropping, format choice or page export may matter more than making the file smaller.\\\"}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"A2ZConvertor is designed for these focused jobs. Instead of opening a full editing suite, you can use Resize Image to prepare cleaner Instagram posts, stories and profile images before upload. The result should still be checked, because no converter can know every upload rule, brand guideline or document requirement you are working with.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"A2ZConvertor is designed for these focused jobs. Instead of opening a full editing suite, you can use Resize Image to prepare cleaner Instagram posts, stories and profile images before upload. The result should still be checked, because no converter can know every upload rule, brand guideline or document requirement you are working with.\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Detailed guide\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Detailed guide\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Instagram rewards images that fit its frames cleanly. A photo can be sharp on your camera roll but still look awkward after Instagram crops it into a square post, vertical story or profile image. Resizing before upload gives you more control over what people actually see in the feed.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Instagram rewards images that fit its frames cleanly. A photo can be sharp on your camera roll but still look awkward after Instagram crops it into a square post, vertical story or profile image. Resizing before upload gives you more control over what people actually see in the feed.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Use Resize Image when your photo is too large, oddly shaped or prepared for a different platform. For feed posts, square and portrait formats are common. For stories and reels covers, vertical layouts usually work better. The goal is to keep the subject, headline text or product detail inside the safe area instead of letting the app crop it automatically.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use Resize Image when your photo is too large, oddly shaped or prepared for a different platform. For feed posts, square and portrait formats are common. For stories and reels covers, vertical layouts usually work better. The goal is to keep the subject, headline text or product detail inside the safe area instead of letting the app crop it automatically.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Creators and small businesses should check the image on a phone-sized preview before posting. Text that looks readable on a laptop can become tiny on mobile. If the edges matter, use Crop Image first, then resize the finished crop. If the file remains large after resizing, Compress Image can make it easier to upload.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Creators and small businesses should check the image on a phone-sized preview before posting. Text that looks readable on a laptop can become tiny on mobile. If the edges matter, use Crop Image first, then resize the finished crop. If the file remains large after resizing, Compress Image can make it easier to upload.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For SEO and social discovery, the visual quality still matters. Clean images improve click-through, profile trust and product presentation. Resizing is not about making every image smaller; it is about matching the platform so the final post looks intentional.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For SEO and social discovery, the visual quality still matters. Clean images improve click-through, profile trust and product presentation. Resizing is not about making every image smaller; it is about matching the platform so the final post looks intentional.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"30:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Step-by-step workflow\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Step-by-step workflow\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Start by opening the original file and checking what you actually need. Look at the destination first: an email attachment, website upload field, social platform, printer, application portal or document editor may have its own preferred format and size. That requirement should guide the workflow.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Start by opening the original file and checking what you actually need. Look at the destination first: an email attachment, website upload field, social platform, printer, application portal or document editor may have its own preferred format and size. That requirement should guide the workflow.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Next, open Resize Image and upload the file. Let the browser finish processing before switching tabs or closing the page. When the download is ready, save it with a clear name so you can tell the converted copy apart from the original.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Next, open Resize Image and upload the file. Let the browser finish processing before switching tabs or closing the page. When the download is ready, save it with a clear name so you can tell the converted copy apart from the original.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Finally, preview the result before using it. Zoom in on text, faces, logos, product details or document numbers. If something looks wrong, go back to the original and adjust the format, size or quality setting rather than repeatedly converting the already-converted file.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Finally, preview the result before using it. Zoom in on text, faces, logos, product details or document numbers. If something looks wrong, go back to the original and adjust the format, size or quality setting rather than repeatedly converting the already-converted file.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For Instagram and other social platforms, also check the crop area on a phone-sized screen. A file can look fine on desktop but lose important detail once it is placed in a square, story or profile frame.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For Instagram and other social platforms, also check the crop area on a phone-sized screen. A file can look fine on desktop but lose important detail once it is placed in a square, story or profile frame.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"31:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Practical tips\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Practical tips\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Use the final destination as your quality test. A high-resolution file may be unnecessary for email, while a tiny file may be a poor choice for print, product photos or detailed screenshots. Good file preparation is not about making every file as small as possible; it is about making it fit the job.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use the final destination as your quality test. A high-resolution file may be unnecessary for email, while a tiny file may be a poor choice for print, product photos or detailed screenshots. Good file preparation is not about making every file as small as possible; it is about making it fit the job.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Do one major change at a time when quality matters. For example, resize first if the dimensions are huge, then compress if the file is still too large. If you need a format change, convert from the original rather than from a heavily compressed copy.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Do one major change at a time when quality matters. For example, resize first if the dimensions are huge, then compress if the file is still too large. If you need a format change, convert from the original rather than from a heavily compressed copy.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Watch for transparency, small text and sharp edges. PNG is often better for screenshots and graphics; JPG is often practical for photos; WEBP is useful for websites; PDF is useful when layout needs to stay together. These are guidelines, not rules, so always check the output.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Watch for transparency, small text and sharp edges. PNG is often better for screenshots and graphics; JPG is often practical for photos; WEBP is useful for websites; PDF is useful when layout needs to stay together. These are guidelines, not rules, so always check the output.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"If the file contains private or sensitive information, remove anything unnecessary before sharing it. Crop extra page margins, export only the pages you need, and avoid sending source files when a smaller preview would do.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"If the file contains private or sensitive information, remove anything unnecessary before sharing it. Crop extra page margins, export only the pages you need, and avoid sending source files when a smaller preview would do.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Real-world example\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Real-world example\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Imagine you are preparing a file at the end of a busy day: a product photo for a listing, a profile image for Instagram, a PDF page for a colleague, or a screenshot for a support form. The fastest route is not to open a full design app. It is to decide what the receiving platform needs, then use Resize Image for that one job.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Imagine you are preparing a file at the end of a busy day: a product photo for a listing, a profile image for Instagram, a PDF page for a colleague, or a screenshot for a support form. The fastest route is not to open a full design app. It is to decide what the receiving platform needs, then use Resize Image for that one job.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For example, if an email rejects a photo because the attachment is too large, the practical fix is usually compression first, not a random format change. If a website form asks for PNG, then a clean JPG to PNG conversion is the right move. If a page preview is needed, exporting a PDF page to an image is more useful than sending the whole document.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For example, if an email rejects a photo because the attachment is too large, the practical fix is usually compression first, not a random format change. If a website form asks for PNG, then a clean JPG to PNG conversion is the right move. If a page preview is needed, exporting a PDF page to an image is more useful than sending the whole document.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"This is where focused browser tools save time. You can test the output immediately, compare it with the original, and repeat once with a different setting if needed. The goal is a file that uploads cleanly, looks professional, and does not create extra work for the person receiving it.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"This is where focused browser tools save time. You can test the output immediately, compare it with the original, and repeat once with a different setting if needed. The goal is a file that uploads cleanly, looks professional, and does not create extra work for the person receiving it.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For SEO, websites and social posts, the same thinking applies. Use descriptive file names, keep images sharp enough for the page, avoid oversized originals, and choose a format that matches how the file will be viewed.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For SEO, websites and social posts, the same thinking applies. Use descriptive file names, keep images sharp enough for the page, avoid oversized originals, and choose a format that matches how the file will be viewed.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"33:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"When free online tools are enough\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"When free online tools are enough\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"A free online tool is usually enough when you need a quick format change, a smaller image, a resized picture, a favicon, or a PDF page preview. These jobs are repeatable, practical and easy to verify by opening the finished file.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"A free online tool is usually enough when you need a quick format change, a smaller image, a resized picture, a favicon, or a PDF page preview. These jobs are repeatable, practical and easy to verify by opening the finished file.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Use A2ZConvertor when the file is ready and the task is specific: convert JPG to PNG, compress an image for email, resize a photo for Instagram, convert PDF to image, or compare JPG, PNG and WEBP before choosing a format.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use A2ZConvertor when the file is ready and the task is specific: convert JPG to PNG, compress an image for email, resize a photo for Instagram, convert PDF to image, or compare JPG, PNG and WEBP before choosing a format.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The best sign that a browser tool is enough is that you can explain the job in one sentence. If the task is make this image smaller for email or turn this PDF page into a JPG preview, a focused tool is a sensible choice.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The best sign that a browser tool is enough is that you can explain the job in one sentence. If the task is make this image smaller for email or turn this PDF page into a JPG preview, a focused tool is a sensible choice.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"You should still preview the output, especially when the file contains text, charts, product details, transparent backgrounds or brand assets. Fast does not mean careless; it means the workflow stays simple.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"You should still preview the output, especially when the file contains text, charts, product details, transparent backgrounds or brand assets. Fast does not mean careless; it means the workflow stays simple.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"34:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Search-friendly file preparation tip\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Search-friendly file preparation tip\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For search and sharing, the file itself should support the page instead of slowing it down. Use the primary phrase naturally near the image, document or download link: resize image for instagram, instagram image size. A clear file name, useful surrounding text and a sensible file size are more valuable than stuffing the same phrase everywhere.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For search and sharing, the file itself should support the page instead of slowing it down. Use the primary phrase naturally near the image, document or download link: resize image for instagram, instagram image size. A clear file name, useful surrounding text and a sensible file size are more valuable than stuffing the same phrase everywhere.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"If you are publishing an image on a website, give it a plain descriptive name before upload. Something like compress-images-for-email-example.jpg is easier to understand than IMG_4821.jpg. For a PDF preview or favicon, use a name that reflects the page or brand rather than a random export name.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"If you are publishing an image on a website, give it a plain descriptive name before upload. Something like compress-images-for-email-example.jpg is easier to understand than IMG_4821.jpg. For a PDF preview or favicon, use a name that reflects the page or brand rather than a random export name.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Internal links also matter. Link from the article to the practical tool, then link back to related guides where the reader can make the next decision. That is why this page includes contextual links, related tools and related articles instead of leaving the guide as a dead end.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Internal links also matter. Link from the article to the practical tool, then link back to related guides where the reader can make the next decision. That is why this page includes contextual links, related tools and related articles instead of leaving the guide as a dead end.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Do not sacrifice usefulness for keywords. A real reader wants a file that uploads, opens and looks right. Search engines increasingly reward pages that solve the task clearly, so the best SEO move is often a cleaner explanation and a better tool link.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Do not sacrifice usefulness for keywords. A real reader wants a file that uploads, opens and looks right. Search engines increasingly reward pages that solve the task clearly, so the best SEO move is often a cleaner explanation and a better tool link.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"35:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"When advanced software makes sense\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"When advanced software makes sense\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Desktop or paid software can be better when the job needs manual retouching, layered design edits, professional print settings, OCR, batch automation, strict document security, or detailed color control. A browser converter is not meant to replace a full creative suite.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Desktop or paid software can be better when the job needs manual retouching, layered design edits, professional print settings, OCR, batch automation, strict document security, or detailed color control. A browser converter is not meant to replace a full creative suite.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Use advanced software if you need to edit the image content itself rather than prepare the file. Removing objects, rebuilding layouts, changing text inside flattened images, repairing damaged PDFs or processing hundreds of files at once is a different class of work.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Use advanced software if you need to edit the image content itself rather than prepare the file. Removing objects, rebuilding layouts, changing text inside flattened images, repairing damaged PDFs or processing hundreds of files at once is a different class of work.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"For everyday file preparation, though, heavy software often slows people down. If the goal is compatibility, upload size, preview format or a clean website asset, Resize Image and the related A2ZConvertor tools are usually the more direct route.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"For everyday file preparation, though, heavy software often slows people down. If the goal is compatibility, upload size, preview format or a clean website asset, Resize Image and the related A2ZConvertor tools are usually the more direct route.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"A sensible workflow is to start simple, check the result, and only move to advanced software when the file genuinely needs advanced editing.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"A sensible workflow is to start simple, check the result, and only move to advanced software when the file genuinely needs advanced editing.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"36:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Common mistakes\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Common mistakes\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-4 space-y-4 leading-8 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The first mistake is deleting the original too early. Keep it until the new file has been accepted by the platform, client, teacher or colleague who needs it. If the result is blurry, too large or missing detail, the original is your clean starting point.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The first mistake is deleting the original too early. Keep it until the new file has been accepted by the platform, client, teacher or colleague who needs it. If the result is blurry, too large or missing detail, the original is your clean starting point.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The second mistake is assuming conversion always reduces file size. Converting JPG to PNG, for example, can create a larger file because PNG solves a different problem. If file size is the main issue, use compression or resizing after choosing the right format.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The second mistake is assuming conversion always reduces file size. Converting JPG to PNG, for example, can create a larger file because PNG solves a different problem. If file size is the main issue, use compression or resizing after choosing the right format.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The third mistake is skipping the preview. A file can technically download correctly while still being wrong for the task. Check the visible details, page order, crop, orientation and output format before you upload or send it.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The third mistake is skipping the preview. A file can technically download correctly while still being wrong for the task. Check the visible details, page order, crop, orientation and output format before you upload or send it.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The fourth mistake is using one tool for every problem. Resize Image is useful for this workflow, but nearby tasks may need a compressor, resizer, cropper, PDF page tool or metadata remover.\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The fourth mistake is using one tool for every problem. Resize Image is useful for this workflow, but nearby tasks may need a compressor, resizer, cropper, PDF page tool or metadata remover.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"37:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Conclusion\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Conclusion\\\"}]